{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01HqRW2WTZsvBxc9hBRJ41Vd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01186RNAbHeZxCn3q5m4rnqT","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","old_string":"- **E1 scope:**","new_string":"- **sos_257 restricted mana:** Added `add_restricted` + `_restricted` tracking\n  to `engine.mana.ManaPool`, and a keyword-only `restricted_ok` to\n  `can_pay`/`pay` (default False, backward compatible). `cast_spell` passes\n  `restricted_ok=True` only for instant/sorcery. Unrestricted mana is spent\n  first so restricted mana is preserved.\n- **sos_257 animation:** Land becomes a creature by in-place mutation (add\n  CREATURE type + update `_original_card_types` so cleanup's\n  `_reset_characteristics` preserves it; add Wizard subtype; set creature\n  scaffolding). P/T are properties that raise AttributeError until animated, so\n  SBA/combat `hasattr` guards skip the un-animated land (SBA zero-toughness has\n  no creature-type guard).\n- **sos_257 pump:** \"+1/+0 until end of turn\" is a direct `_pump` counter (the\n  layer system only recomputes at cleanup, too late for mid-turn combat). Reset\n  at upkeep (`BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent`), since no end-of-turn event is\n  fired. Limitation: pump lingers between a turn's cleanup and the next upkeep,\n  unobservable in practice.\n- **Ability activation in tests:** activated/loyalty/mana abilities are not\n  auto-wired into the priority loop, so tests fetch the ability by printed index\n  from the card's `get_*_abilities()` hook and drive it through the engine's\n  `activate_ability` (the real activation path) — not by calling effects\n  directly.\n\n- **E1 scope:**"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":327,"cache_read_input_tokens":292116,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":327},"output_tokens":47,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"88686e67-15f6-420e-923b-5a5a834e5552","uuid":"d31cc8cc-7f0e-4c87-b83c-f2ef788f1217","request_id":"req_011CbuF3UcnpxYuhHhbwM5RP"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01186RNAbHeZxCn3q5m4rnqT","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"88686e67-15f6-420e-923b-5a5a834e5552","uuid":"b3122ff4-96be-4c95-b543-371a72cc001d","timestamp":"2026-06-10T08:12:50.369Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","oldString":"- **E1 scope:**","newString":"- **sos_257 restricted mana:** Added `add_restricted` + `_restricted` tracking\n  to `engine.mana.ManaPool`, and a keyword-only `restricted_ok` to\n  `can_pay`/`pay` (default False, backward compatible). `cast_spell` passes\n  `restricted_ok=True` only for instant/sorcery. Unrestricted mana is spent\n  first so restricted mana is preserved.\n- **sos_257 animation:** Land becomes a creature by in-place mutation (add\n  CREATURE type + update `_original_card_types` so cleanup's\n  `_reset_characteristics` preserves it; add Wizard subtype; set creature\n  scaffolding). P/T are properties that raise AttributeError until animated, so\n  SBA/combat `hasattr` guards skip the un-animated land (SBA zero-toughness has\n  no creature-type guard).\n- **sos_257 pump:** \"+1/+0 until end of turn\" is a direct `_pump` counter (the\n  layer system only recomputes at cleanup, too late for mid-turn combat). Reset\n  at upkeep (`BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent`), since no end-of-turn event is\n  fired. Limitation: pump lingers between a turn's cleanup and the next upkeep,\n  unobservable in practice.\n- **Ability activation in tests:** activated/loyalty/mana abilities are not\n  auto-wired into the priority loop, so tests fetch the ability by printed index\n  from the card's `get_*_abilities()` hook and drive it through the engine's\n  `activate_ability` (the real activation path) — not by calling effects\n  directly.\n\n- **E1 scope:**","originalFile":"# KEY_DECISIONS.md — SOS card implementation log\n\nOne short entry per ambiguity, deviation from TODO.md, or deliberate\ncard-local limitation. Source of truth is `card_spec.json` + `RULEBOOK.txt`.\n\n- **sos_1 exile-instead:** TODO suggested a `ReplacementEffect` for \"if that\n  spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead\", but the engine\n  never consults replacements for stack→graveyard spell resolution. Smallest\n  correct change: a `_exile_on_resolve` flag read at the one right point in\n  `engine.casting._resolve_spell`. Limitation: only redirects on resolution,\n  not on countering (covers the cards in this set).\n- **sos_1 attack trigger / engine:** `AttacksTriggeredEvent` was defined and\n  registered by many FDN cards but never fired by combat. Added a minimal\n  additive firing in `engine.combat.declare_attackers_step` after attackers are\n  declared (fires `creature=attacker`). Justified by sos_1's attack trigger;\n  also fixes Etali et al.\n- **sos_1 \"may cast target\":** single legal graveyard target auto-selects (per\n  TODO); multiple → `choose_card` picks one or returns None to decline.\n\n- **E1 scope:** `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` is fired only from `cast_spell`\n  (normal casts), not from `cast_spell_free` or `copy_spell`, per the TODO.\n  Consequence: free casts (Etali-style) and spell copies do not fire \"you\n  cast a spell\" triggers. Deliberate, matches the plan's note that copies are\n  not \"cast\". Populated `spell` (the StackObject), `card`, `controller`, and\n  `player` (alias) for FDN-compat condition readers.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":17,"oldLines":6,"newStart":17,"newLines":28,"lines":[" - **sos_1 \"may cast target\":** single legal graveyard target auto-selects (per","   TODO); multiple → `choose_card` picks one or returns None to decline."," ","+- **sos_257 restricted mana:** Added `add_restricted` + `_restricted` tracking","+  to `engine.mana.ManaPool`, and a keyword-only `restricted_ok` to","+  `can_pay`/`pay` (default False, backward compatible). `cast_spell` passes","+  `restricted_ok=True` only for instant/sorcery. Unrestricted mana is spent","+  first so restricted mana is preserved.","+- **sos_257 animation:** Land becomes a creature by in-place mutation (add","+  CREATURE type + update `_original_card_types` so cleanup's","+  `_reset_characteristics` preserves it; add Wizard subtype; set creature","+  scaffolding). P/T are properties that raise AttributeError until animated, so","+  SBA/combat `hasattr` guards skip the un-animated land (SBA zero-toughness has","+  no creature-type guard).","+- **sos_257 pump:** \"+1/+0 until end of turn\" is a direct `_pump` counter (the","+  layer system only recomputes at cleanup, too late for mid-turn combat). Reset","+  at upkeep (`BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent`), since no end-of-turn event is","+  fired. Limitation: pump lingers between a turn's cleanup and the next upkeep,","+  unobservable in practice.","+- **Ability activation in tests:** activated/loyalty/mana abilities are not","+  auto-wired into the priority loop, so tests fetch the ability by printed index","+  from the card's `get_*_abilities()` hook and drive it through the engine's","+  `activate_ability` (the real activation path) — not by calling effects","+  directly.","+"," - **E1 scope:** `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` is fired only from `cast_spell`","   (normal casts), not from `cast_spell_free` or `copy_spell`, per the TODO.","   Consequence: free casts (Etali-style) and spell copies do not fire \"you"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
