{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01YZPwaLG8HGVPSZkJS39e1N","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The working tree is clean and every item is committed. All work is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nAll ten SOS cards plus the three shared engine seams are implemented, tested through the real engine, and committed (one commit per item). **Final state: 1251 tests pass** (1145 engine regression tests never regressed, plus 56 new SOS tests and the FDN reference tests).\n\n**Shared engine seams (built first, reused by ≥2 cards):**\n- **E1** — fire `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` in `cast_spell` (→ sos_226, sos_257)\n- **E2** — add + fire `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` from `advance_phase` (→ sos_57, sos_120)\n- **E3** — aggregate battlefield `spell_cost_reduction` in `get_cost_reduction` (→ sos_245)\n\n**The ten cards:**\n| Card | Key mechanics |\n|---|---|\n| sos_4 Together as One | Converge (colors spent) — draw/damage/lifegain |\n| sos_1 The Dawning Archaic | graveyard cost reduction, Reach, attack free-cast, exile-instead |\n| sos_245 Witherbloom | affinity self + granted affinity (E3) |\n| sos_226 Silverquill | Casualty 1 (E1 + `copy_spell`) |\n| sos_257 Great Hall | restricted mana, {5} land→creature animation, spell-cast pump |\n| sos_57 Mana Sculpt | counter (fdn_48 pattern) + delayed mana (E2) |\n| sos_120 Improvisation Capstone | exile-until-MV4 free casts + recurring Paradigm copy (E2) |\n| sos_13 Emeritus // Swords | ETB token, \"prepared\", cast-from-exile copy |\n| sos_201 Lorehold | Miracle (first-draw-this-turn) + opponent-upkeep loot |\n| sos_97 Ral Zarek | surveil / discard / reanimate / coin-flip skip-turns |\n\n**Engine changes — all additive, never renaming/moving/deleting symbols:** fired the previously-dead `AttacksTriggeredEvent` and `SpellCastTriggeredEvent`/precombat-main event; a `_exile_on_resolve` flag in `_resolve_spell`; `mana_spent` recording; restricted-mana support in `ManaPool`; `game.rng` and `player.skip_turns` with skip handling in `advance_phase`.\n\n**Deviations & deliberate card-local limitations** are logged in `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md` — notably: the engine never fires self-ETB triggers (so sos_13's enter effect runs in `on_resolve`), no end-of-turn event exists (sos_257's pump resets at upkeep), and replacements aren't consulted for stack→graveyard (sos_1 uses a flag instead). Each was chosen as the smallest correct change rather than a speculative subsystem."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":684,"cache_read_input_tokens":420693,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":684},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"88686e67-15f6-420e-923b-5a5a834e5552","uuid":"4c5618d0-bd1e-4f2f-886f-baf5c10c70b7","request_id":"req_011CbuGxAGL4tV3B5f328SPr"}
